{"3787980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Gridfire","steam_appid":3787980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4846760],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/b0fff2525afa22824fff800a67db1744.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=644 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>top-down shooter<\/strong> built around <strong>PvP<\/strong> combat. Fight <strong>Free-for-All<\/strong>, or take a side in team modes: Capture the Flag, Capture Points, VIP Escort, Domination and Team Deathmatch.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/0847817fab91e59397e3a1c1f191d7f9.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a straight free-for-all for the highest score — or take on maps built for 2, 3 or 4 teams, each with its own objective. Steal every enemy flag and run it home. Hold every control point on the map. Protect your VIP while hunting theirs. Or settle it with team deathmatch. Bots fill out the teams, so a match is always ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/1f9925b3d21fb4fe701e23e004ea0029.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to sit up straight at a keyboard to compete. Gridfire plays fully on a controller.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/7d377e2eddf79772b21c36a39c0b80f2.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying straight at the enemy is how you lose. Gridfire rewards position. Use your secondary weapons to force enemies out of cover, and take the ground worth taking. Some walls let fire through in one direction only. Some floors speed you up, others slow you down. With teammates, nothing works unless you coordinate.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECIBEL DRIVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfire can be flown with your mouth instead of your hands. Say <strong>&quot;pew&quot;<\/strong> to fire, <strong>&quot;pshhh&quot;<\/strong> for your secondary, trill your lips to move, and hum to heal. It is a real way to play, it is ridiculous, and it is very hard to do quietly.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR OWN MAPS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in editor lets you build your own arenas and hand them to other people. Host a match for your friends over Steam, or join theirs.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/b0fff2525afa22824fff800a67db1744.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=644 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>top-down shooter<\/strong> built around <strong>PvP<\/strong> combat. Fight <strong>Free-for-All<\/strong>, or take a side in team modes: Capture the Flag, Capture Points, VIP Escort, Domination and Team Deathmatch.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/0847817fab91e59397e3a1c1f191d7f9.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a straight free-for-all for the highest score — or take on maps built for 2, 3 or 4 teams, each with its own objective. Steal every enemy flag and run it home. Hold every control point on the map. Protect your VIP while hunting theirs. Or settle it with team deathmatch. Bots fill out the teams, so a match is always ready.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/1f9925b3d21fb4fe701e23e004ea0029.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to sit up straight at a keyboard to compete. Gridfire plays fully on a controller.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/extras\/7d377e2eddf79772b21c36a39c0b80f2.avif?t=1793659940\" width=615 height=125 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying straight at the enemy is how you lose. Gridfire rewards position. Use your secondary weapons to force enemies out of cover, and take the ground worth taking. Some walls let fire through in one direction only. Some floors speed you up, others slow you down. With teammates, nothing works unless you coordinate.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECIBEL DRIVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gridfire can be flown with your mouth instead of your hands. Say <strong>&quot;pew&quot;<\/strong> to fire, <strong>&quot;pshhh&quot;<\/strong> for your secondary, trill your lips to move, and hum to heal. It is a real way to play, it is ridiculous, and it is very hard to do quietly.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE YOUR OWN MAPS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A built-in editor lets you build your own arenas and hand them to other people. Host a match for your friends over Steam, or join theirs.<\/p>","short_description":"A fast top-down PvP shooter: capture flags, hold points and escort the VIP across six modes and dozens of maps. Build and share your own maps, play with friends — or switch on Decibel Drive and fly your ship using your voice.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/9c3259d54c09a6fa6865a5b0170485f148243c70\/header.jpg?t=1793659940","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/b23ee7741e434374ab1a2df440436d0e56970588\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793659940","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3787980\/b23ee7741e434374ab1a2df440436d0e56970588\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793659940","website":"http:\/\/www.grid-fire.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon R7 360 \/ Intel UHD 630<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 600 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> N\/A<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> N\/A<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1080p \/ 30–60 FPS. Integrated graphics supported.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 \/ AMD Radeon RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> N\/A<br><\/li><li><st